---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import { SITE } from "@/config";
---

<Layout title={`About · ${SITE.title}`}>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" class="app-layout pt-10 pb-20">
    <article class="max-w-prose-app">
      <header class="mb-12">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground">
          About
        </p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
          NihilDigit
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm text-muted-foreground">Shibo Liu</p>
      </header>

      <section class="space-y-6 text-foreground/90 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          I'm a third-year undergraduate at
          <a
            href="https://www.ncst.edu.cn/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent"
          >North China University of Science and Technology</a>, studying
          intelligence science. I use frontier AI to push into the
          problems that genuinely excite me.
        </p>

        <p>
          <a
            href="/anvil"
            class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent"
          >ANVIL</a> grew out of two threads I'd been pulling on: I'm
          picky about frame rate, and I'd been tinkering with mobile NPUs.
          Standard flow-based VFI breaks down under INT8 quantization, so
          I went looking for alternatives and landed on reusing the H.264
          decoder's motion vectors instead of learning optical flow. The
          paper is under review at IEEE TCSVT; the project page collects
          the training code, the Android demo, and the arXiv preprint.
        </p>

        <p>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/NihilDigit/RAFNet"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent"
          >RAFNet</a> was my first academic project. We built a classifier
          for student behavior in crowded classrooms on top of GroupRec, an
          existing hypergraph encoder, with a gated fusion head; I ran the
          experiments. It's under review at The Visual Computer.
        </p>

        <p>
          I want my code to do something for people, not just sit in a
          repo. A fair amount of free time goes to open source &mdash;
          most visibly
          <a
            href="https://github.com/NihilDigit/waybar-ai-usage"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent"
          >waybar-ai-usage</a>, a Waybar widget that shows quota and reset
          time for Claude Code, Codex CLI, Copilot, and OpenCode Zen. It's
          packaged on AUR.
        </p>

        <p>
          A short list of things I'm into: LLMs, Linux, ACGN, Rammstein.
          Beyond just using them, I find different language models
          genuinely fascinating &mdash; each one has its own character,
          and I spend a lot of hours just talking to them. ACGN bleeds
          into what I build: an upstream
          <a
            href="https://github.com/open-ani/animeko/pull/2978"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent"
          >PR in review for cloud offline-download</a> in Animeko (an
          open-source anime streaming app), and
          <a
            href="https://github.com/NihilDigit/renpak"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent"
          >renpak</a>, an AVIF compression toolchain for Ren'Py visual
          novels.
        </p>
      </section>

      <hr class="my-12 border-border" />

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground">
          Education
        </h2>
        <dl class="grid grid-cols-[6rem_1fr] gap-x-6 gap-y-2 font-mono text-sm">
          <dt class="text-muted-foreground tabular-nums">2023 &ndash;</dt>
          <dd>
            B.S. in Intelligence Science<br />
            <span class="text-muted-foreground">
              College of Science · NCST · Tangshan, Hebei, China
            </span>
          </dd>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <hr class="my-12 border-border" />

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground">
          Contact
        </h2>
        <dl class="grid grid-cols-[6rem_1fr] gap-x-6 gap-y-2 font-mono text-sm">
          <dt class="text-muted-foreground">Email</dt>
          <dd class="space-y-1">
            <div>
              <a
                href="mailto:spencerliu@stu.ncst.edu.cn"
                class="hover:text-accent"
              >spencerliu<span class="text-muted-foreground">[at]</span>stu.ncst.edu.cn</a>
              <span class="text-muted-foreground"> · school</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <a
                href="mailto:starse.nd233@gmail.com"
                class="hover:text-accent"
              >starse.nd233<span class="text-muted-foreground">[at]</span>gmail.com</a>
              <span class="text-muted-foreground"> · personal</span>
            </div>
          </dd>

          <dt class="text-muted-foreground">GitHub</dt>
          <dd>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/NihilDigit"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="hover:text-accent">@NihilDigit</a
            >
          </dd>

          <dt class="text-muted-foreground">ORCID</dt>
          <dd>
            <a
              href="https://orcid.org/0009-0004-9426-3713"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="hover:text-accent">0009-0004-9426-3713</a
            >
          </dd>

          <dt class="text-muted-foreground">Telegram</dt>
          <dd>
            <a
              href="https://t.me/NihilDigit"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="hover:text-accent">@NihilDigit</a
            >
          </dd>

          <dt class="text-muted-foreground">Zhihu</dt>
          <dd>
            <a
              href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/stars-50-20"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="hover:text-accent">stars-50-20</a
            >
          </dd>
        </dl>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
